    "detailed_description": "<strong>\ud83c\udf34 Birdy's Island - An Adventure Like No Other \ud83d\udc26</strong><br><br>Welcome to Birdy's Island, a place where you live the life of a bird, exploring, protecting, and enjoying the freedom of the skies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/d570b50e43160440745fd272da341946.poster.avif?t=1732470966\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/d570b50e43160440745fd272da341946.webm?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/d570b50e43160440745fd272da341946.mp4?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Defend Your Territory \ud83d\udeab</strong><br><br>Humans have started to invade the island, threatening its natural beauty. As a bird, it's your duty to protect your home in unique ways.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/7aca2fa22bac1411c54854f19d95d7f6.poster.avif?t=1732470966\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/7aca2fa22bac1411c54854f19d95d7f6.webm?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/7aca2fa22bac1411c54854f19d95d7f6.mp4?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f Soar Through the Skies \ud83c\udf05</strong><br><br>Experience the thrill of flight, feeling the wind beneath your wings as you explore the island from above.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/73e05a5c91f0efe8fa9cb69146273fa1.poster.avif?t=1732470966\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/73e05a5c91f0efe8fa9cb69146273fa1.webm?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/73e05a5c91f0efe8fa9cb69146273fa1.mp4?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf0a Dive and Swim \ud83d\udc1f</strong><br><br>Birdy's Island isn't just about flying. Dive into the crystal-clear waters and discover the aquatic beauty of your home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/4a0eaa240bb1a26d8ab06b93904781e1.poster.avif?t=1732470966\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/4a0eaa240bb1a26d8ab06b93904781e1.webm?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/4a0eaa240bb1a26d8ab06b93904781e1.mp4?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Nurture the Environment \ud83c\udf33</strong><br><br>Show your commitment to nature by planting trees with a special touch. Your actions help restore the island\u2019s greenery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/945ea597cbfd6861d30cf1e33d69b2db.poster.avif?t=1732470966\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/945ea597cbfd6861d30cf1e33d69b2db.webm?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/945ea597cbfd6861d30cf1e33d69b2db.mp4?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>\ud83d\udeae Witness the Impact of Pollution \ud83c\udf0d</strong><br><br>See firsthand the damage humans can cause as you visit a once pristine beach now littered with pollution. It's a call to action for every bird.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/6e7564e9665e0a7e36917f193a03f386.poster.avif?t=1732470966\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/6e7564e9665e0a7e36917f193a03f386.webm?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/6e7564e9665e0a7e36917f193a03f386.mp4?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf33 Find Peace in Nature \ud83c\udf38</strong><br><br>Amidst the battles and challenges, find moments of tranquility as you stroll through the park, reminding you of what you\u2019re fighting for.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/ae150b1529d2e8c146da8ff348715d74.poster.avif?t=1732470966\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/ae150b1529d2e8c146da8ff348715d74.webm?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/ae150b1529d2e8c146da8ff348715d74.mp4?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>\ud83c\udf34 Birdy's Island - An Adventure Like No Other \ud83d\udc26</strong><br><br>Welcome to Birdy's Island, a place where you live the life of a bird, exploring, protecting, and enjoying the freedom of the skies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/d570b50e43160440745fd272da341946.poster.avif?t=1732470966\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/d570b50e43160440745fd272da341946.webm?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/d570b50e43160440745fd272da341946.mp4?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Defend Your Territory \ud83d\udeab</strong><br><br>Humans have started to invade the island, threatening its natural beauty. As a bird, it's your duty to protect your home in unique ways.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/7aca2fa22bac1411c54854f19d95d7f6.poster.avif?t=1732470966\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/7aca2fa22bac1411c54854f19d95d7f6.webm?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083760/extras/7aca2fa22bac1411c54854f19d95d7f6.mp4?t=1732470966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f Soar Through the Skies \ud83c\udf05</strong><br><br>Experience the thrill of flight, feeling the wind beneath your wings as you explore the island from above.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay